OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a dry day with
OL,6,Fvariable amounts of cloud and a few
OL,7,Fsunny intervals, best of any sunshine
OL,8,Facross the west. Light northeasterly
OL,9,Fwind.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry and
OL,12,Fpartly cloudy. Then the rest of the
OL,13,Fnight will be dry with variable
OL,14,Famounts of cloud. Frost and fog where
OL,15,Fskies remain clear.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FMainly dry although rather
OL,18,Fcloudy at times. in the east with the
OL,19,Fodd light shower. Brightest along the
OL,20,Fwest coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
