OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,6,Fsettled although rather cloudy at
OL,7,Ftimes especially in the east. Chance
OL,8,Fof one or two light showers in the
OL,9,Feast. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
